## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-code: illustrate policy check flow
function checkPolicy(tenantId, prompt) {
  const policies = loadPolicies(tenantId);
  if (containsPII(prompt) || violatesRegulations(prompt, policies)) {
    redact(prompt);
    throw new Error("Policy violation");
  }
  return prompt;
}
```

